{"lyrics":"[Intro: Kodak Black]\n[00:07.42]I ain't really finna tell y'all how to get away with murder and shit\n[Chorus]\n[00:09.40]Make sure you put codeine in my casket\n[00:12.64]And some Perkies and my ratchet\n[00:15.22]Wreaking havoc, like a savage\n[00:17.86]I'm just tryna catch a play like Madden\n[00:20.40]Make sure you keep your seat belt fastened\n[00:22.88]I drive wild and I really love crashin'\n[00:25.44]I love drugs, but I ain't no addict\n[00:28.24]I'm lyin', I'm lyin'\n[Verse 1]\n[00:30.78]They say love is a drug, I'm about to OD\n[00:33.56]She love cocaine, but she hate the nosebleeds\n[00:36.00]She's dying, she's dying\n[00:38.62]I'm too busy getting high, no crying\n[00:41.50]Fuck nigga better not tempt me\n[00:44.16]I'ma use his head as a centerpiece\n[00:46.36]He's dyin', he's dyin'\n[00:48.96]Put an end to his world like the Mayans\n[Bridge]\n[00:51.92]Oh-oh-oh, I'm crazy, crazy\n[00:56.60]Get so damn high, I see faces, faces\n[Chorus]\n[01:01.28]Make sure you put codeine in my casket\n[01:04.54]And some Perkies and my ratchet\n[01:07.10]Wreaking havoc, like a savage\n[01:09.76]I'm just tryna catch a play like Madden\n[01:12.28]Make sure you keep your seat belt fastened\n[01:14.82]I drive wild and I really love crashin'\n[01:17.34]I love drugs, but I ain't no addict\n[01:20.12]I'm lyin', I'm lyin'\n[Verse 2]\n[01:22.82]I can't feel my face, is it still there?\n[01:25.60]Girl, let me taste, why won't you share?\n[01:28.26]I still see your shadows in my room\n[01:30.82]Wake up in the morning and you're not there\n[01:33.56]I see your face in my crosshairs\n[01:35.98]Cupid aimin' at me with a gun, and I'm not scared\n[01:38.60]Prolly why I fall for the same damn thing every god-damn time\n[01:42.32]I guess life's not fair\n[Bridge]\n[01:44.86]Oh-oh-oh, I'm crazy, crazy\n[01:48.46]This rock star lifestyle, won't make it, make it\n[Chorus]\n[01:53.18]Make sure you put codeine in my casket\n[01:56.44]And some Perkies and my ratchet\n[01:59.00]Wreak